{
  "_comment": "Runtimes LINA installs for itself (lina#32, lina#34), read by hermes_cli/lina_ocx.py and hermes_cli/lina_omo.py. Node serves OCX, omo and ocx-omo (>= 24); its sha256 per platform comes from nodejs.org/dist/v<version>/SHASUMS256.txt. The OCX and omo integrity is npm's dist.integrity for that exact version; tests/hermes_cli/test_lina_deps_pin.py checks it against the registry. Runners (lina#222): `npm` runners are installed like omo, and their integrity is npm's dist.integrity; `binary`/`tarball` runners come from the URL their own installer script downloads, checked against `sha256` or `sha512` per platform (agy's sha512 is its release manifest's; grok and cursor-agent publish none, so LINA recorded the sha256 of the official artifact, and grok's GCS md5 matched). `sign_in` names the read-only check in hermes_cli/lina_runners.py; `env` is set in the shim LINA runs them through.",
